Z||000000||Neverfinished||05-13-2001||11:07 PM||||What a weekend... Wash my car... rain... wash my car...rain...wash my car...rain...<BR>Those who own dark colored fieros, have you noticed how annoying they are to keep clean?<BR>well I guess that is the price to pay for having such a beautiful car! <BR>friday I bumped into a guy with a black 88 gt. We got to talking and he let me drive it for 20 minutes.awesome car!!!! I neeed a 88 gt. also bumped into an 87 gt and talked for an hour on the side of the road. we got honked at about 10 times with people giving us the thumbs up. Also I fried my 12inch sub so now i need a new one.what a piss off.<BR>just took some pics of the car and will get them developed tommorrow so everyone can see the most beautiful 84SE in existence.<BR>C-ya||||reg||10
Z||000001||FieroLisa||05-13-2001||11:13 PM||||Ya know, I totally understand the dark car dilemma- mine is never ever really clean! I think I could go through a bottle of polish a week to keep it looking nice!!!!!<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT: 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air intake<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A><P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/daytona1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Neverfinished||05-13-2001||11:16 PM||||fierolisa, I painted mine last year about the same color as yours just alot darker. I love that color. I hate it when you spend an hour washing your car and go for a drive and your car is covered with pollen and little fluff things. I should invest in one of those car brushes.||||reg||1
Z||000003||mrfiero||05-13-2001||11:37 PM||||I also own a black '88 GT and I feel your pain!  When I wash and wax her I go for a quick cruise to show it off before the dust settles....literally.  Within minutes there is a layer of dust on it and when condensation forms or it rains that dust turns to ugly spots all over the finish until the next time I wash it.  I do keep a cover on it, but that only does so much.<P>On the positive side.....there is NOTHING nicer than a clean, freshly waxed black car (IMHO).  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>  ||||reg||10
