Z||000008||kslish||05-14-2001||01:08 AM||||My neighbors look at me strange because I'm always outside nearly every evening washing or wiping down my Fieros when they get dirty.<P>One thing is for sure, I sure wish I had a garage.  I think birds use my bright red one for target practice.<P>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000009||Old Lar||05-14-2001||11:28 AM||||White cars are a pain to clean.  I spent most of this weekend on it, and I can't tell where the wax was put on.  No visable haze to wipe off.  A couple of more times and it should be nice and clean and waxed.<P>If you are going to the Dells, a California duster is a must.  Yellow pine pollen all the time.||||reg||1
