Z||000016||FieroJoe||05-14-2001||09:42 PM||||If I've got a fresh coat of wax on, and it rains and the dust from my gravel driveway settles on it and makes all those little dirt spots, I use Meguiar's Quik Detailer mist & wipe.  Works great if you need to get the car mostly clean and "fresh" before you go out.  You spray it on, and then wipe it off with a clean rag, and turn the rag often to a clean side (picks up all the dirt)  I like it, works well.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
